    "title": {
      "en": "Swallow or Swift?"
    },
    "text": {
      "en": "Look at the wings and the colour. A Swift is all dark, with long, narrow, sickle-shaped wings, and flaps in quick bursts. A Swallow is blue-black above and pale below, with a red throat and long tail streamers, and it glides in loops."
    }
